Discussion
The wider infrastructure that supported P3GPT's development also featured autonomous AI agents to streamline the validation process. We have successfully enabled most tests featured in this preprint with the functionality provided by Langchain and CrewAI. As the Precious project and the broader AI field continue to mature, we intend to extend the range of functions carried out by AI agents. Ultimately, we envision a not-so-distant future in which AI systems manage end-to-end research projects in which a Precious-like model occupies a central role ( Figure 2 ).

